Build Docker Image:
-------------------
    docker build -t sai/demoqa-selenium.1

    what happens internally:
    ------------------------
        . = build context
        docker sends all files to daemon
        pulls base image (python 3.10)
        creates new image with your code

    Image Content:
    ---------------
        your image includes:
            python runtime
            installed packages
            selenium scripts
            api scripts

        So container = ready-to-run automation
